@startuml 12-Agent Hive Queen Swarm Topology

!define QUEEN_COLOR #FF6B9D
!define ARCHITECT_COLOR #4ECDC4
!define CODER_COLOR #95E1D3
!define TESTER_COLOR #FEA47F
!define VALIDATOR_COLOR #F4D03F

title 12-Agent Hive Queen Swarm for Weaver Core Refactor

' Queen Coordinator
agent "👑 Queen Coordinator\n(Orchestration)" as Queen #QUEEN_COLOR

' Architecture Layer
package "Architecture Layer" #ARCHITECT_COLOR {
  agent "🏗️ Schema Architect\n(Define telemetry schemas)" as SchemaArch
  agent "🎨 System Architect\n(Design Weaver integration)" as SysArch
  agent "🔧 Refactor Planner\n(Plan migration strategy)" as RefactorPlanner
}

' Implementation Layer
package "Implementation Layer" #CODER_COLOR {
  agent "💻 Core Coder\n(Refactor test engine)" as CoreCoder
  agent "🔌 Integration Coder\n(Weaver live-check integration)" as IntegrationCoder
  agent "📦 Generator Coder\n(Code generation from schemas)" as GeneratorCoder
}

' Testing Layer
package "Testing Layer" #TESTER_COLOR {
  agent "🧪 London TDD Specialist\n(Mock-driven tests)" as TDDSpec
  agent "🐳 Docker Validator\n(Container integration)" as DockerValidator
  agent "📊 Telemetry Validator\n(OTLP export validation)" as TelemetryValidator
}

' Validation Layer
package "Validation Layer" #VALIDATOR_COLOR {
  agent "✅ Weaver Validator\n(Live-check execution)" as WeaverValidator
  agent "🔍 Schema Validator\n(Registry validation)" as SchemaValidator
  agent "📝 Documentation Agent\n(Update all docs)" as DocAgent
}

' Communication Flows

Queen -down-> SchemaArch : delegates schema definition
Queen -down-> SysArch : delegates system design
Queen -down-> RefactorPlanner : delegates migration planning

SchemaArch -down-> CoreCoder : provides schemas
SchemaArch -down-> GeneratorCoder : provides schemas
SysArch -down-> IntegrationCoder : provides design
RefactorPlanner -down-> CoreCoder : provides migration plan

CoreCoder -down-> TDDSpec : triggers mock tests
IntegrationCoder -down-> TelemetryValidator : triggers telemetry tests
GeneratorCoder -down-> SchemaValidator : triggers schema tests

TDDSpec -down-> WeaverValidator : provides test artifacts
DockerValidator -down-> WeaverValidator : provides container tests
TelemetryValidator -down-> WeaverValidator : provides telemetry

WeaverValidator -up-> Queen : validation results
SchemaValidator -up-> Queen : schema validation results
DocAgent -up-> Queen : documentation status

' Feedback loops
WeaverValidator ..> CoreCoder : validation failures
WeaverValidator ..> IntegrationCoder : integration issues
SchemaValidator ..> SchemaArch : schema improvements

' Task Distribution
note right of Queen
  **Queen Responsibilities**

  1. Task decomposition
  2. Agent coordination
  3. Progress monitoring
  4. Consensus management
  5. Result aggregation
  6. Decision making
end note

note bottom of SchemaArch
  **Schema Architect**

  1. Define test_execution.yaml
  2. Define container_lifecycle.yaml
  3. Define plugin_system.yaml
  4. Define metrics schemas
  5. Define event schemas
  6. Validate with weaver registry check
end note

note bottom of CoreCoder
  **Core Coder**

  1. Refactor TestEngine to use generated builders
  2. Instrument all code paths with telemetry
  3. Ensure OTLP export on all operations
  4. Replace manual spans with schema-driven
  5. Implement error telemetry
end note

note bottom of TDDSpec
  **London TDD Specialist**

  1. Generate mocks from schemas
  2. Write failing tests (Red)
  3. Guide implementation (Green)
  4. Validate refactors
  5. Ensure mock contracts match schemas
end note

note bottom of WeaverValidator
  **Weaver Validator**

  THE CRITICAL AGENT

  1. Run weaver registry live-check
  2. Collect all telemetry
  3. Validate against schemas
  4. Report violations
  5. Block merge if validation fails

  THIS IS THE SOURCE OF TRUTH
end note

' Parallel Execution Pattern
note as ParallelNote #FFEB9C
  **Concurrent Execution Pattern**

  Queen spawns all 11 agents in SINGLE message:

  Task("Schema Architect", "Define schemas...", "system-architect")
  Task("System Architect", "Design integration...", "system-architect")
  Task("Refactor Planner", "Plan migration...", "planner")
  Task("Core Coder", "Refactor engine...", "coder")
  Task("Integration Coder", "Integrate Weaver...", "coder")
  Task("Generator Coder", "Generate code...", "coder")
  Task("TDD Specialist", "Mock-driven tests...", "tdd-london-swarm")
  Task("Docker Validator", "Validate containers...", "tester")
  Task("Telemetry Validator", "Validate OTLP...", "tester")
  Task("Weaver Validator", "Run live-check...", "production-validator")
  Task("Schema Validator", "Validate schemas...", "reviewer")
  Task("Doc Agent", "Update documentation...", "reviewer")

  ALL IN ONE MESSAGE = MAXIMUM PARALLELISM
end note

@enduml
